    headline: "USB-C hub Ethernet works but HDMI doesn't: the USB side can work while video fails.",
    description: "Working Ethernet proves the USB data path is alive. It does not prove the host USB-C port supports DisplayPort video. Isolate host video support, cable capability, HDMI output, and dock mode.",
